	(text "POWER INPUT: VIN 12-24V (fan rail, F1 5A, 1oz copper) + 5V (F2 5A), mini blade 32V, no regulator. D21 SMCJ28A / D22 SMBJ5.0A crowbar: reverse polarity or 12-24V on the 5V input blows the fuse. LD7 = VIN present, LD8 = 5V present"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "060e120c-d08f-4e98-83bc-bc5b45d8157a")
	)
	(text "MCU: Waveshare RP2350-Zero on female headers, USB powered. 5V pin left open (no backfeed)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "441cb5f0-aebe-494a-a740-9ffc5ca55e7f")
	)
	(text "FANS 1-6: JPx selects VIN (1-2) or 5V (2-3). JMx: 2-3 = 4-pin PWM fan (GND through PTC), 1-2 park = 2/3-pin fan (AO3400A switches fan GND from the 5V PWM line via 22k, 5.6V zener on the gate, B5819W flyback). Fx 1.6A PTC in each fan return (fans up to ~1A) trips on a shorted cable. 2N7002 (Q10-Q15) = 3V3->5V PWM shifter. Tach: 10k pull-up, 4.7k + BAT54S clamp. LDx lights when the port is powered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "06bea25b-1d2e-4d42-bcf3-d9e7a3c5b167")
	)
	(text "LED OUTPUTS: JLx selects VIN (1-2) or 5V (2-3) for the strip, data is 5V: 74HCT2G17 dual buffer (TTL-level inputs) + 1k series + BAT54S clamp (survives +V on the data pin), 2A PTC in each strip return, 10k pull-downs keep LEDs quiet when the MCU is off"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109.22 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "20f82687-44e6-4d20-b980-89299692e400")
	)
	(text "EXP: GP14, GP15 + 3V3 + GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ec3758e8-c8dd-4d05-aa72-a10a7b75389f")
	)
	(text "THERMISTOR INPUTS TH1-TH4 (GP26-GP29 ADC): 100k NTC to GND, 4.7k 1% pull-up to 3V3, 100nF filter"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 215.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6fd01618-8e70-4fd1-8e43-70e5d882d603")
	)
